nts a  legacy there is a dragon in him  so viserys is a complicated guy author  george martin said he's impressed with  considering's performance giving viserys  a tragic majesty that he never had in  the books  one of the biggest problems for viserys  is his brother prince daemon targaryen  daemon is like the opposite of viserys  because while viserys is peaceful daemon  is violent and impulsive actor matt  smith said damon is there to cause chaos  and piss people off daemon rides the red  dragon karaxis called the blood worm and  daemon's personality is reflected in his  dragon's personality karaxis is like a  huge rabid dog volatile and chaotic  there are at least 17 dragons in this  story and the showrunners say we'll meet  9 of them in season 1. each dragon has a  distinct personality colour and look  some of them are bearded like tropical  lizards karaxis is apparently a deformed  dragon with a super long neck and extra  wings on his hind legs these unique  designs contrast with the dragons in  game of thrones which were almost  impossible to tell apart despite their  colourful descriptions in the books  prince daemon is a great warrior he  wields the legendary valyrian steel  sword dark sister once used by queen  visenya and used by king maegor the  cruel  in the trailers we see daemon leading  the city watch of king's landing called  the gold cloaks we saw the gold cloaks  in game of thrones betraying ned in  season one and buying crab aphrodisiacs  in season seven cause daemon is  commander of the city watch and he's the  one who first gave the watch their gold  cloaks and better armor so daemon is why  they're now called gold cloaks daemon  gets real enthusiastic about law  enforcement especially the part where  you cut body parts off criminals as  commander of the watch he's known as the  prince of the city or lord flee bottom  daemon has an estranged wife called raya  royce who he hates and calls his bronze  [ __ ]  damon considers himself heir to the  t